    {
      "id": "guia_titulo",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 482,
      "y": 526,
      "w": 896,
      "h": 20,
      "text": {
        "es": "EJERCICIO RECOMENDADO",
        "en": "RECOMMENDED EXERCISE"
      },
      "font_size": 11,
      "bold": true,
      "text_color": "#5f676e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g0",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 556,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "1. Inicia sesión como operador. En «Sala de cocción» elige la receta Tostada, el FV3 e INICIAR LOTE.",
        "en": "1. Log in as an operator. In “Brewhouse”, choose recipe Tostada, FV3 and START BATCH."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 600,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "2. Confirma la malta en el empaste y los lúpulos en el hervido cuando lo pida el aviso.",
        "en": "2. Confirm the malt in the mash and the hops in the boil when prompted by the notice."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 644,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "3. Activa «Espuma en el hervor» durante el hervido: reconoce la alarma y mira cómo el PLC baja el vapor.",
        "en": "3. Activate “Foam on Boil” during boiling: Acknowledge the alarm and watch the PLC lower the steam."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 688,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "4. Con el lote en el FV3, activa «Fallo de la enfriadora»: sigue en Bodega cómo se desvían las temperaturas.",
        "en": "4. With the batch in the FV3, activate “Chiller Failure”: follow in the Cellar how the temperatures deviate."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g4",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 732,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "5. Inicia sesión como operador e intenta guardar una receta: no puedes. Hazlo como maestro cervecero.",
        "en": "5. Log in as an operator and try to save a recipe: you can't. Do it as a brewmaster."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "g5",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 486,
      "y": 776,
      "w": 890,
      "h": 40,
      "text": {
        "es": "6. Cuando el FV2 esté «Listo para envasar», abre su «Mando…» y trasiégalo para dejarlo libre.",
        "en": "6. When the FV2 is “Ready to pack”, open its “Control…” and move it to clear it."
      },
      "font_size": 13,
      "bold": false,
      "text_color": "#24292e",
      "text_align": "left"
    }
